<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Labour Board says May unemployment 7.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Swedish Labour Board says May unemployment 7.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's Labour Market Board said on Thursday that May unemployment rose to 7.6 percent from 7.5 percent in April.  </p>
<p> SWEDISH UNEMPLOYMENT	 May '97     April '97  May '96</p>
<p> Percent of workforce	 7.6	   7.5	     7.6</p>
<p> Number of unemployed	 321,000     317,594   323,748</p>
<p>Note - Statistics Sweden will release its May unemployment figures on June 6 with analysts in a Reuter poll targeting 7.9 percent. According to Statistics Sweden, April unemployment amounted to 8.3 percent.</p>
<p>-- Birgitta Forsberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
